doctype html
html(lang="ja")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1")
    title 404 Not Found | CULTURE LOG
    link(rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2285%22>📚</text></svg>")
    link(href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet")
    link(href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet")
    style.
      .glitch-404 {
        font-size: 6rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }
      .film-strip {
        border-top: 8px dashed #212529;
        border-bottom: 8px dashed #212529;
      }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .film-strip {
        border-color: #ffc107;
      }

  body.min-vh-100.d-flex.align-items-center(
    data-bs-theme=currentTheme
    class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'bg-warning bg-gradient' : ''
  )
    .container.py-5
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-md-8.col-lg-6
          .card.shadow-lg.border-0.overflow-hidden
            //- フィルム風装飾バー
            .bg-dark.text-warning.text-center.py-2.small.fw-bold.film-strip
              | 🎬 SCENE 404  :  MISSING REEL / 落丁ページ 📚

            .card-body.p-5.text-center
              .glitch-404.mb-2(class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'text-dark' : 'text-warning') 404
              h2.h4.fw-bold.mb-3 このページは制作段階でカットされました。

              //- 小ネタ評価表示（ダーク時は bg-body-tertiary で自然に馴染ませる）
              .bg-body-tertiary.rounded.p-3.mb-4.text-start.small.border.border-secondary.border-opacity-25
                .d-flex.justify-content-between.mb-1
                  span.fw-bold 作品名：幻の404ページ
                  span.text-warning ☆☆☆☆☆ (0.0)
                .text-body-secondary
                  | 開始0秒で真っ白な画面で終わってしまった orz

              .d-grid
                a.btn.btn-lg.rounded-pill.fw-bold(
                  href="/posts"
                  class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'btn-dark' : 'btn-warning'
                )
                  i.bi.bi-film.me-2
                  | 本編へ戻る